   5: #   the GATE     loop/work/window-gate.ps1  - PreToolUse on the Agent tool: denies a spawn at the line
   6: #   the ALARM    loop/work/window-alarm.cmd - PostToolUse on every tool: exit 2 puts the line in front of the model
   7: #   the STAMP    loop/work/stamp-hook.ps1   - UserPromptSubmit: the founder sees it on every prompt
