  66: # Every hook is a real child process with real redirected stdin - the deployment shape, not an
  67: # in-process call that could pass while the deployed command fails.
  68: function Start-Hook([string]$script, [pscustomobject]$p) {
  69:     # A missing script is a RED, never a crash. This drill is written before the machinery it
  70:     # tests, so "not built yet" has to read as a failed assertion with a name, not as a run that
  71:     # stops halfway and reports nothing.
