  74:   `statusline.ps1` computes the verdict from the in-memory snapshot via the lib, writes
  75:   `window-verdict.txt` FIRST, then writes `rate-limits.json`, both inside ONE try block. A
  76:   verdict-write failure therefore also skips the snapshot write.
