 182: # A separate run with ONE deliberately failing call and nothing else, so an alarm in this
 183: # transcript cannot have been delivered by the success event.
 184: $c = Invoke-Case 'alarm-failure' $dirOver @'
 185: Run exactly one shell command that is guaranteed to fail, by invoking a program that does not exist, for example: definitely-not-a-real-program-xyz. Run nothing else at all, do not retry, do not spawn anything. Then say DONE and stop.
 186: '@
