 191:     Write-Output '        PostToolUseFailure, drop that ONE settings entry, keep everything else, and record'
 192:     Write-Output '        the residual gap - an actor whose calls all fail still hears the alarm at its next'
 193:     Write-Output '        successful call, its next spawn attempt, or the founder next prompt stamp.'
 194: }
